## block-pressure

block-pressure-ask = On which face will the block press on the table hardest?
block-pressure-title = What pressure does a block put on the table?
block-pressure-question = We weigh a wooden block on a dynamometer and measure its length, width and height with a ruler. The block can lie on the table on three different faces. On which face will it press on the table hardest?
block-pressure-choices = On the largest face
block-pressure-choices-2 = On the smallest face
block-pressure-choices-3 = The same — the weight is the same
block-pressure-setup = A wooden block, a dynamometer, a ruler
